q40 changes to gsplat at 937e299, issue #40. Measurement harness, not a Node.

To reproduce the trainer used by fit2.sh:
  git -C gsplat checkout 937e299
  git -C gsplat apply --exclude=examples/simple_trainer_tiles.py $PWD/q40-gsplat-937e299.patch
  cp gsplat/examples/simple_trainer.py gsplat/examples/simple_trainer_tiles.py
  git -C gsplat apply --include=examples/simple_trainer_tiles.py $PWD/q40-gsplat-937e299.patch

The tiled trainer renders each full-resolution training image in tiles and
accumulates gradients across them before one optimizer step, so a step still
covers one whole image. Scoring is eval_splat.py, shared by every run.

